   },
   "label": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "c22_4218",
   "type": "note",
   "x": 100,
   "y": 605,
   "rot": 0,
   "params": {
    "text": "One 22 uF times the 555, the other passes its edges to the speaker (the toc-toc). RP1 is a variable resistor (wiper to one end).",
    "size": "10"
   },
   "label": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "c23_2137",
   "type": "note",
   "x": 100,
   "y": 620,
   "rot": 0,
   "params": {
    "text": "At 20 % (50k): f = 1.44 / ((R1 + 2 RP1) C1) = 0.648 Hz, 39 beats a minute; 0.26 Hz at 250k. Power-on transient: 5 s.",
